ice/code body denies unknown fields.","summary":"The Clax app cannot sign in to a hosted Clax running main's code: start_sign_in sends client_kind, which main's DeviceCodeBody refuses, and the app says only 'Try again'","supersedes":"acc6523336aa1c98d82d9bd2f263e215d3c54a157d27cd12b4f38bed3135cf28","tags":["review","review:app-push-pull-deep","compat","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"crates/clax-server/src/public.rs","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-23T06:11:51.153679Z","id":"2224db007c5d9df92178039a46d1e479d50c62dc9da85751906a631a89156033","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:526e6616b","summary":"Fixed: start_sign_in answers 502 remote_too_old to an old public Clax's 400 invalid_json naming client_kind. Test api_remotes_app::app_sign_in_to_a_public_clax_from_before_client_kinds_is_remote_too_old (//crates/clax-server:integration__6) passes; with the guard removed it fails. Deploy order (hosted before app) in docs/superpowers/specs/2026-10-21-app-push-pull-design.md section 10. bazelisk test (clax-store, clax-core, clax-http, clax-server lib + integration__1..6, clax-embed:old_homes, clax-mcp) at 3acda5ff0: 'Executed 15 out of 15 tests: 15 tests pass.'","supersedes":"55853e00afbdbac1cb7531de329b8822edcea0b309edcce74d261844573194b6","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:b2fb951f-3ceb-4c65-a7b7-a705e815488a"]}}
